# 工具生成的 UI 测试 golden（dylint compiletest_rs / trybuild）：末尾 blank line 是 rustc
# "N warnings emitted\n\n" 渲染的固有产物。compiletest_rs 逐字节比较 `actual == expected`
# （不 trim 尾部换行，见 compiletest_rs runtest.rs `compare_output`），删除该 blank 即破坏 golden
# 精确匹配 → UI 测试红。故对这些工具产物豁免 git 空白检查（`git diff --check` / `git apply
# --whitespace` 的 blank-at-eof / trailing-space），对齐 rust-lang/rust 对 `.stderr` 的处理。
*.stderr -whitespace
# AssemblyLock hashes raw bytes; assembly-modules-check verifies this effective checkout policy.
assemblies/*/src/generated/** text eol=lf
assemblies/*/assembly.lock.json text eol=lf
assemblies/*/runtime-plan.json text eol=lf
deploy/generated/*.deployment-plan.json text eol=lf
deploy/helm/rss/plans/*.deployment-plan.json text eol=lf
deploy/helm/rss/values/*.yaml text eol=lf
deploy/helm/rss/values.yaml text eol=lf
deploy/helm/rss/values.schema.json text eol=lf
deploy/helm/rss/tests/golden/*.yaml text eol=lf
generated/l2-assurance.json text eol=lf
generated/provider-capability-matrix.json text eol=lf
